{"status": "ok", "message-type": "work-list", "message-version": "1.0.0", "message": {"facets": {}, "total-results": 41316, "items": [{"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 8, 19]], "date-time": "2026-08-19T17:49:47Z", "timestamp": 1787161787490, "version": "build-2736575974"}, "posted": {"date-parts": [[2024, 12, 20]]}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE)", "license": [{"start": {"date-parts": [[2024, 12, 20]], "date-time": "2024-12-20T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 1734652800000}, "content-version": "unspecified", "delay-in-days": 0, "URL": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "abstract": "<jats:p>The rapid growth of Large Language Models (LLMs) has revolutionized business operations across sectors such as finance, healthcare, customer service, and more. These models are no longer experimental but are becoming core components in streamlining workflows and decision-making. However, the integration of LLMs brings new challenges: ensuring the accuracy of outputs, monitoring model performance, and maintaining strict compliance with industry regulations[1]. This white paper provides an in-depth review of leading LLM tracing and evaluation tools, examining their strengths, limitations, and relevance for real-world use cases. We aim to guide organizations in choosing the right tools to enhance model performance, ensure compliance with data security protocols, and generate actionable insights.</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.36227/techrxiv.173473181.10918695/v1", "type": "posted-content", "created": {"date-parts": [[2024, 12, 20]], "date-time": "2024-12-20T16:56:57Z", "timestamp": 1734713817000}, "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 2, "title": ["Harnessing Large Language Models (LLMs) Optimizing Performance, Monitoring, and Compliance"], "prefix": "10.36227", "author": [{"ORCID": "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5199-8366", "authenticated-orcid": false, "given": "Edwin", "family": "Jose", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [{"name": "Department of Computer Science Western, Michigan University Kalamazoo"}], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "Prasad", "family": "Prabhakaran", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [{"name": "Head of Artificial Intelligence esynergy London"}], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}], "member": "263", "link": [{"URL": "https://www.techrxiv.org/doi/pdf/10.36227/techrxiv.173473181.10918695/v1", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2026, 6, 12]], "date-time": "2026-06-12T15:07:00Z", "timestamp": 1781276820000}, "score": 29.43012, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://www.techrxiv.org/doi/full/10.36227/techrxiv.173473181.10918695/v1"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2024, 12, 20]]}, "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.36227/techrxiv.173473181.10918695/v1", "published": {"date-parts": [[2024, 12, 20]]}, "subtype": "preprint"}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2025, 12, 2]], "date-time": "2025-12-02T23:52:06Z", "timestamp": 1764719526535, "version": "3.46.0"}, "posted": {"date-parts": [[2023, 9, 28]]}, "group-title": "Open Science Framework", "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Center for Open Science", "license": [{"start": {"date-parts": [[2023, 9, 28]], "date-time": "2023-09-28T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 1695859200000}, "content-version": "unspecified", "delay-in-days": 0, "URL": "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode"}], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "abstract": "<p>The world is facing an unprecedented climate crisis, with environmental challenges threatening ecosystems, biodiversity, and human well-being. To address these pressing issues effectively, innovative approaches are essential. One such approach involves leveraging Large Language Models (LLMs), advanced AI technologies like GPT-3, to assist in climate modeling, data analysis, and finding solutions to environmental challenges. This article explores how LLMs are playing a transformative role in the fight against climate change and environmental degradation.</p>", "DOI": "10.31219/osf.io/rwy9d", "type": "posted-content", "created": {"date-parts": [[2023, 9, 29]], "date-time": "2023-09-29T01:02:30Z", "timestamp": 1695949350000}, "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 1, "title": ["Harnessing the Power of Large Language Models (LLMs) for Climate Modeling and Environmental Solutions"], "prefix": "10.31219", "author": [{"given": "Smith", "family": "Jasmin", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}, {"given": "Williams", "family": "fred", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "15934", "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2025, 12, 2]], "date-time": "2025-12-02T23:49:45Z", "timestamp": 1764719385000}, "score": 26.755468, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://osf.io/rwy9d_v1"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2023, 9, 28]]}, "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.31219/osf.io/rwy9d", "published": {"date-parts": [[2023, 9, 28]]}, "subtype": "preprint"}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 7, 18]], "date-time": "2026-07-18T16:45:39Z", "timestamp": 1784393139029, "version": "3.55.0"}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "SCITEPRESS - Science and Technology Publications", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "published-print": {"date-parts": [[2024]]}, "DOI": "10.5220/0012596800003636", "type": "proceedings-article", "created": {"date-parts": [[2024, 2, 29]], "date-time": "2024-02-29T05:30:56Z", "timestamp": 1709184656000}, "page": "491-498", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 8, "title": ["Exploring Text-Generating Large Language Models (LLMs) for Emotion Recognition in Affective Intelligent Agents"], "pr